  "about": "Shared photographic material library (asset round 3). Each material: <name>_albedo (sRGB), <name>_normal (tangent space, OpenGL / green-up, the Godot convention), <name>_roughness (linear grey). 1024 x 1024. Albedos generated with GPT Image 2.6 (low quality, 0.25 credits each) as top-down or frontal flat-lit photos; made seamless by offset-and-blend (half-tile offset copy blended in at the borders with a smoothstep mask, local contrast restored), then normal maps from a high-passed luminance height (Sobel) and roughness from a per-material base modulated by local luminance (crevices rougher, highlights smoother). Import as Lossy (WebP) with mipmaps, never VRAM; normals with compress/normal_map=1. Cards (pine_branch_card, moss_card) are not tiled: their albedo PNG has an alpha channel cut from the black background, for alpha-scissor foliage cards.",
